 "strings": {
  "Let's do it right!": "",
  "December 3rd, just around nine o'clock.": "",
  "December 3rd, just around 9 o'clock.": "",
  "Right out front of Club Amour.": "",
  "Outside Kamurocho's Club Amour.": "",
  "An argument breaks out between Captain Hamura of the\nMatsugane Family and Kume and Murase of the Kyorei Clan.": "",
  "The Matsugane Family's Captain Hamura and the\nKyorei Clan's Kume and Murase have a heated discussion.": "",
  "Hamura and his thugs drag Kume into the club.": "",
  "Hamura and his thugs\ndrag Kume into the club.": "",
  "At which point, Murase abandons\nKume and flees the scene.": "",
  "At that point, Murase abandons\nKume and flees the scene.": "",
  "Hamura then locks Kume in Amour for around an hour,\nwhile he and his boys beat the daylights out of the guy.": "",
  "For the next hour or so, Hamura and\nhis boys beat the daylight out of Kume.": "",
  "Around 10 PM, Hamura kicks everyone out,\nleaving only himself and Kume in the club.": "",
  "At around 10 PM, Hamura kicks everyone out,\nleaving only himself and Kume inside.": "",
  "Up to that point, their story matches the camera footage\nand the testimony we have from the owner of Amour.": "",
  "The camera footage and the club owner's\ntestimony all match up until that point.": "",
  "The prosecution's story continues as follows.": "",
  "And according to the prosecution...": "",
  "Once the two of them were alone,\nHamura tortured Kume even more violently.": "",
  "Hamura only got more violent\nwith poor Kume at that point.": "",
  "Then between 2:00 and 3:00 AM...": "",
  "Then,\nbetween two and three in the morning...": "",
  "He drove a sharp weapon into Kume's eye,\nkilling him instantly.": "",
  "He drove a sharp instrument through\nKume's eye, killing him instantly.": "",
  "Once he finished gouging Kume's eyes out,\nHamura dumped the body in the alley behind Amour.": "",
  "After gouging out both eyes, Hamura\ndumped the body in the alley behind Amour.": "",
  "When questioned, Hamura said...": "",
  "In his interrogation,\nHamura made a statement.": "",
  "\"Me and Kume left Amour 'round midnight.\nI went for a steam right after.\"": "",
  "\"Kume and I left around midnight.\nI went for a steam right after.\"": "",
  "But since no evidence can back up that claim,\nthe prosecution doubts its credibility.": "",
  "But with no evidence to back that claim up,\nthe prosecution doubts his alibi.": "",
  "6:00 AM on the morning of the 4th,\nKume's body was found.": "",
  "Kume's body was found\nat 6 AM on the 4th.": "",
  "And one week later,\nthey arrested Hamura.": "",
  "They brought Hamura in a week later.": "",
  "What we know is,\nWaku was taken out of his room...\n": "",
  "We know the old man\nwas taken out of his room...": "",
  "...sometime between 7:50, when he was last seen,\nand 8:30 when everyone noticed he was gone. ": "",
  "Sometime between 7:50 and 8:30,\nwhen people noticed he was gone.": "",
  "During that 40 minute span...": "",
  "Okubo had 40 minutes...": "",
  "...somebody suffocated Waku\nand stuffed him into the laundry bin.": "",
  "In that time, Waku was suffocated\nand stuffed in a laundry cart.": "",
  "Nobody suspected\nthere was a body in the cart.": "",
  "No one suspected there was\na body in the cart, naturally.": "",
  "And the only clear culprit was Okubo,\nthe man in charge of the laundry.": "",
  "Signs clearly point to the man\nin charge of the cart, Okubo.": "",
  "To further back this up, DNA evidence\nfrom Waku was found in Okubo's truck.": "",
  "Furthermore, Waku's DNA was\nfound in Okubo's truck.": "",
  "And when the police questioned Okubo, he confessed\nto burying the body in the mountains of Okutama.": "",
  "When questioned, Okubo confessed to\nburying the body in the Okutama mountains.": "",
  "Three months after the crime,\nWaku's corpse was finally found.": "",
  "It took three months before they\nfinally found Waku's body.": "",
  "I'm sure Waku-san's death\ncame as a complete shock to you.": "",
  "Waku-san's death came as a\ncomplete shock to you, didn't it?": "",
  "But you didn't have time to panic.\nYou needed to hide the body, fast.": "",
  "But, in your panic,\nhiding the body sounded practically logical.": "",
  "So, you used the laundry cart\nto transport it without raising suspicion.": "",
  "And the laundry cart was\nthe perfect way to get him out.": "",
  "You just needed to get it\nas far away as possible.": "",
  "You just wanted to get him\nas far away as possible.": "",
  "Then, just before 8:00 AM, Shinpei Okubo\narrived at the hospital to gather the linens.": "",
  "Then Shinpei Okubo showed up at work\nto gather the sheets just before 8:00.": "",
  "That was your chance. You waited for an opening.\nHid the body in his truck.": "",
  "It was your shot. You saw an opening\nand hid the body in his truck.": "",
  "That wouldn't solve anything, though.": "",
  "Still... What would happen if Okubo\nfound him and called the cops?": "",
  "Okubo would find Waku-san,\nand of course call the cops.": "",
  "Not much of a solution, was it?": "",
  "Naturally, they'd then search\nfor whoever stashed the body there.": "",
  "They'd open a search for whoever\nstashed the body in the truck.": "",
  "But you didn't have\nany other choice, did you?": "",
  "But in your mind, you didn't\nhave much choice, did you?": "",
  "You had to take the risk.\nAnd somehow, it paid off.": "",
  "Turned out Shinpei Okubo had a criminal record, and was\nworried the police would suspect he murdered Waku-san.": "",
  "Turns out, Shinpei Okubo had a criminal record,\nand was worried <font_kind=yakuza_italic>he'd</font_kind> be the prime suspect.": "",
  "So he didn't report it...": "",
  "So instead...": "",
  "Instead choosing to bury the body\ndeep in the Okutama mountains.": "",
  "He took Waku-san up to the\nmountains and buried him there.": "",
  "First... we got his gun.": "",
  "The first thing we did\nwas get his gun.": "",
  "The Mole was the one who\nused it to kill Shintani.": "",
  "We left using the gun to\noff Shintani to the Mole.": "",
  "He replaced the one bullet he fired, got rid of any\ntraces that he used it, and put it back in Ayabe's holster.": "",
  "He replaced the used bullet, scrubbed the evidence,\nand put it back in Ayabe's holster.": "",
  "That meant that the bullet found in the body\nwould have the rifling marks from his gun.": "",
  "That way, the bullet found in the body\nwould have the rifling marks from his gun.": "",
  "Which meant it was\nan unshakable fact...": "",
  "It was all but ironclad...": "",
  "...That Shintani was shot\nwith Ayabe's weapon.": "",
  "...That Shintani was shot by a\ngun owned by Officer Ayabe.": "",
  "The year is 2018.": "",
  "Kamurocho is playing host\nto Kansai-based yakuza...": "",
  "Kamurocho is playing\nhost to Kansai-based yakuza...": "",
  "...Who have been turning up dead\nwith their eyes gouged out.": "",
  "...Who have been turning up\ndead with their eyes gouged out.": "",
  "Lawyer-turned-detective\nTakayuki Yagami took on the case... ": "",
  "Lawyer-turned-detective\nTakayuki Yagami took on the case...": "",
  "...Proving the suspect's alibi.": "",
  "But he can't shake the feeling\nthat the true culprit is out there.": "",
  "He gives this anonymous killer a name.": "",
  "He gives this\nanonymous killer a name...": "",
  "Yagami calls him, \"the Mole.\"": "",
  "Matsugane Family Captain, Kyohei Hamura,\nis connected to the Mole.": "",
  "Confirming his suspicions,\nYagami's progress is impeded.": "",
  "The entire city is under\nHamura's surveillance...": "",
  "And it went deeper than he knew.": "",
  "Alone and out of options,\nYagami receives a little support.": "",
  "The night is still young.": "",
  "As Yagami chases the Mole,\nthe Matsugane Family's net tightens.": "",
  "A year ago, Kaito was expelled from the family,\nand its power structure changed entirely.": "",
  "But the whole thing was a setup.": "",
  "In Kamurocho, men are pulled into\nthe criminal underworld's currents.": "",
  "But those that refuse to submit\nto its tides will always struggle.": "",
  "The Tojo Clan is struck\nby Kyorei Clan gunfire.": "",
  "Kamurocho's disarray\nonly spreads wider. ": "",
  "On the surface, the diagram\nresembles a yakuza turf war.": "",
  "But in the shadows are glimpses of\na construction firm and political influence.": "",
  "And in Yagami's own shadow...": "",
  "The Mole's sharp claws\nclaim yet another victim.": "",
  "The Mole's latest victim\nwas the lawyer, Shintani.": "",
  "The last call he made brings the case that ruined\nYagami three years ago back to the surface.": "",
  "A patient was taken from a hospital\nand found buried in the mountains.": "",
  "Yagami defended the suspect, Shinpei Okubo,\nand got an acquittal, but one month later...": "",
  "He murdered his girlfriend, Emi Terasawa,\nwith a kitchen knife and burned the remains.": "",
  "With the Mole's\nmurder of Shintani...": "",
  "The police begin to suspect\nYagami and subpoena him.": "",
  "The cases of both past and present\nbecome a volatile mix at the ADDC.": "",
  "At one point, the land it sits on had been\nthe target of a redevelopment scheme.": "",
  "At one point, the land it sits on had been\nthe target of a redevelopment strategy.": "",
  "And behind that plan,": "",
  "And the one behind that plan...": "",
  "The Kansai-based construction company,\nthe Kajihira Group...": "",
  "The Kansai-based construction company,\nthe Kajihira Group...　": "",
  "And its chairman, Shigeru Kajihira.": "",
  "In the roaring din of the city, the death of the\nADDC's vice director hardly made a sound.": "",
  "Behind his death are the\nvast profits of the AD-9 drug.": "",
  "Yagami arrives at the possibility that\nall the deaths were premeditated...": "",
  "But the prosecution's eye for\nsuch detail is wanting.": "",
  "And Detective Ayabe is indicted\nfor Shintani's murder.": "",
  "The Mole was Hamura's\npersonal underworld assassin.": "",
  "With a mounting threat\nbehind them...": "",
  "Yagami and Kaito are forced\nto cut ties with Matsugane.": "",
  "And the two set foot\ndown a path of no return.": "",
  "Finally, the name of a mastermind\nbubbles to the surface.": "",
  "The man is an AD-9 researcher...": "",
  "Yoji Shono.": "",
  "Three years ago, a dementia patient\nat the ADDC was murdered.": "",
  "Even now, Shinpei Okubo, the man\nconvicted of the crime, pleads innocence.": "",
  "But Yagami's theory that this chain of events was\nset in motion by human experimentation for AD-9...": "",
  "...Unveils the true culprit\nbehind Emi Terasawa's death.": "",
  "AD-9's dark human experiments...": "",
  "The Mole, who facilitated them...": "",
  "As Yagami gets closer to\nthe truth, the trap is sprung.": "",
  "Details come at the\ncost of Kaito's blood...": "",
  "And each word that Hamura,\nthe Matsugane Family captain speaks...": "",
  "...Pulls back the veil\na little further.": "",
  "The Matsugane Family and\nthe Mole mount an assault.": "",
  "And the Kamurocho ambitions\nof the Kyorei Clan crumble.": "",
  "Betrayed by his inner circle,\nHamura becomes a target himself.": "",
  "So he reveals to Yagami\nthe Mole's true identity.": "",
  "He is Kamurocho's Organized Crime\nDivision Detective, Kuroiwa...": "",
  "The man who took Matsugane's life...": "",
  "...Falls under the shield\nof AD-9's powerful benefactors.": "",
  "The AD-9 conspiracy entangled\nthe ADDC's Director Kido.": "",
  "The same man who had\nunveiled it to the world.": "",
  "An unfinished drug that\nexacted human sacrifice...": "",
  "Yagami believed he'd finally\nfound definitive proof.": "",
  "But even that was\nswallowed by the darkness.": "",
  "All for the \"greater good\"...": "",
  "...Of a drug that would\nsave humanity.": "",
  "Can't believe it.": "",
  "Oh, damn.": "",
  "What the hell...": "",
  "Oh yeah!": "",
  "That was close...": "",
  "Perfect.": "",
  "Niiice.": "",
  "Don't be like that.": "",
  "Pardon me.": "",
  "All right!": "",
  "Farewell.": "",
  "Are you sure?": "",
  "Will do.": "",
  "Hmm...": "",
  "Shut up.": "",
  "No problem.": "",
  "What is it?": "",
  "Are you serious?": "",
  "Yeah, sure.": "",
  "Exactly.": "",
  "Good idea.": "",
  "Nope.": "",
  "I figured as much.": "",
  "Hey there.": "",
  "I think so.": "",
  "Maybe.": "",
  "That's what I'm talking about!": "",
  "Not yet.": "",
  "Gotcha.": "",
  "Me too.": "",
  "Okay.": "",
  "Are you okay?": "",
  "Yeah, let's do it.": "",
  "Wait, you're inviting all your friends...\nAnd you're paying? You loaded or something?": "",
  "They say your body actually gets weaker if you\ntrain everyday. Is that true? Weird, right?": "",
  "Where'd all that brand-name shit come from?\nYou come it some money? How'd you get it?": "",
  "I heard you got a new car?\nHow'd you afford it? What happened?": "",
  "You partied all night at that cabaret?\nYou got money to burn or something?": "",
  "I made a reservation for a haircut.\nYes, I asked for Matsushita-san.": "",
  "I'm in Kamurocho right now.\nYeah. Yeah, got it, I'll head over.": "",
  "Huh? If the street's on that side,\nthat means... this way?": "",
  "Whoa, I kinda overspent this month,\ndidn't I? Credit cards are scary...": "",
  "Yeah, exactly. It stopped working after that.\nWhen can I get it replaced?": "",
  "Huh? Who the hell're you!?": "",
  "Shhh. I'm just here to talk, Murase-san.": "",
  "Look, I risked my life to get in here. Just—": "",
  "Look, I risked my life\nto get in here. Just—": "",
  "I don't have to do shit!\nYou can't boss a yakuza around!": "",
  "You're not gettin' away!": "",
  "Sugiura: Let go, asshole!\nKaito: Bastard's got my leg!": "",
  "Let go, asshole!": "",
  "Just stay down!": "",
  "Aw shit!": "",
  "We'll be fine, Tak!": "",
  "There's more!": "",
  "Yeah, but...!": "",
  "Just go, Tak!\nWe'll be fine!": "",
  "I told you, just go!": "",
  "All right. You've got this!": "",
  "Got it.\nGood luck, guys!": "",
  "Here! This way!": "",
  "It's Yagami!": "",
  "Yagami!": "",
  "Holy shit!": "",
  "That was close!": "",
  "Don't shoot, dumbass!": "",
  "Whoa!\nD-Don't shoot!": "",
  "You fuckin' coward!\nLet go of him!": "",
  "And why would I do that?": "",
  "I'll kill ya!": "",
  "What the!?": "",
  "You dropped something!": "",
  "What the... Yagami!?": "",
  "Hehehe...": "",
  "Hah!": "",
  "Buy me some time, boys.\nDo whatever it takes.": ""
